  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted (P101; P102 A; P103 A; P201 A; P202 G; P301 F; P302 F; P401 E; Flood Risk Assessment; Sustainable Drainage Assessment; Energy Statement; Received 18/02/2021; Planning Statement; Received 03/06/2021.) therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority before the building is used.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - Notwithstanding the approved plans, prior to the occupation as a single family house, two cycle parking spaces shall be provided at the rear garden in accordance with the standards embodied in West London Cycle Parking Guidance."
